23dg|n|Water, or water and dirt, thrown upon anything, or thrown from a puddle or the like; also, a spot or daub, as of matter which wets or disfigures. ; A noise made by striking upon or in a liquid.	a:1ajr,69,3;1529,59,6;8an,52,9;1fdu,51,1;1xw6,43,5;9dr,38,2;3b2,14,3~8an,52,9;1529,59,6;1xw6,43,5;1ajr,69,3;3b2,14,3;9dr,38,2;1fdu,51,1	v:1xw6,20,1~1xw6,20,1	n:2bon,81,21;1fdu,76,6;9dr,68,16;1xw6,60,16;y87,4,1~2bon,81,21;9dr,68,16;1xw6,60,16;1fdu,76,6;y87,4,1	N:1yxk,103,13;1yxc,90,160;1ajr,69,3;1kmr,34,3~1yxc,90,160;1yxk,103,13;1ajr,69,3;1kmr,34,3
23dg|v|To strike and dash about, as water, mud, etc.; to plash. ; To spatter water, mud, etc., upon; to wet. ; To strike and dash about water, mud, etc.; to dash in such a way as to spatter.	o:1yxc,26,2~1yxc,26,2
