23f2|n|A rectangular piece fitting grooves like key seats in a hub and a shaft, so that while the one may slide endwise on the other, both must revolve together; a feather; also, sometimes, a groove to receive such a rectangular piece. ; A long, flexble piece of wood sometimes used as a ruler.	N:1vxf,174,7~1vxf,174,7
