23kt|n|A small shoot or branch; a twig. ; A collective body of small branches; as, the tree has a beautiful spray. ; A side channel or branch of the runner of a flask, made to distribute the metal in all parts of the mold. ; A group of castings made in the same mold and connected by sprues formed in the runner and its branches.	a:zgx,100,8;15x,98,4;28sk,82,6;e8t,11,1~zgx,100,8;28sk,82,6;15x,98,4;e8t,11,1	v:zgx,70,1;711,54,23~711,54,23;zgx,70,1	V:1ko6,106,6;ofk,97,2~1ko6,106,6;ofk,97,2	n:zgx,122,38;15w,106,32;2108,100,5;1qwm,49,10~zgx,122,38;15w,106,32;1qwm,49,10;2108,100,5	N:1ko0,104,12;ofk,103,3~1ko0,104,12;ofk,103,3
