. ; That which springs, or is originated, from a source; ; A race; lineage. ; A youth; a springal. ; A shoot; a plant; a young tree; also, a grove of trees; woodland. ; That which causes one to spring; specifically, a lively tune. ; The season of the year when plants begin to vegetate and grow; the vernal season, usually comprehending the months of March, April, and May, in the middle latitudes north of the equator. ; The time of growth and progress; early portion; first stage. ; A crack or fissure in a mast or yard, running obliquely or transversely. ; A line led from a vessel's quarter to her cable so that by tightening or slacking it she can be made to lie in any desired position; a line led diagonally from the bow or stern of a vessel to some point upon the wharf to which she is moored.	o:zq4,101,4;15lt,87,4;247r,84,19;1zip,76,121;1ziq,59,6;28aa,42,16;1cmi,41,3;1a8,38,7;9vw,21,2;e5w,15,3~1zip,76,121;247r,84,19;28aa,42,16;1a8,38,7;1ziq,59,6;zq4,101,4;15lt,87,4;1cmi,41,3;e5w,15,3;9vw,21,2	s:247r,57,3;228e,44,5;2hgk,6,4~228e,44,5;2hgk,6,4;247r,57,3	d:otd,25,4~otd,25,4
23ls|n|One who, or that which, springs; specifically, one who rouses game. ; A young plant. ; The impost, or point at which an arch rests upon its support, and from which it seems to spring. ; The bottom stone of an arch, which lies on the impost. The skew back is one form of springer. ; The rib of a groined vault, as being the solid abutment for each section of vaulting. ; The grampus. ; A variety of the field spaniel. See Spaniel. ; A species of antelope; the sprinkbok.	a:1jjn,6,21~1jjn,6,21	v:gj4,53,9;13w8,30,11~13w8,30,11;gj4,53,9	V:1s2q,42,2;h1i,33,8;2h5,28,5;1s2r,19,4;2g0v,18,3;1s2n,17,8;1ybo,12,3;1s2k,8,3;1it4,7,4~1s2n,17,8;h1i,33,8;2h5,28,5;1s2r,19,4;1it4,7,4;1ybo,12,3;1s2k,8,3;2g0v,18,3;1s2q,42,2	n:1s2o,37,6;gj2,19,6;19yi,17,46~19yi,17,46;1s2o,37,6;gj2,19,6	N:1ads,95,6;7vs,80,4;1s2q,66,10;1gd6,60,32;19cp,58,34;25ko,53,3;282d,47,3;1r17,47,6;17gz,44,39;1zxn,41,5;rt2,38,9;9cr,38,9;9by,36,16;2g0v,34,9;29i7,32,2~17gz,44,39;19cp,58,34;1gd6,60,32;9by,36,16;1s2q,66,10;9cr,38,9;rt2,38,9;2g0v,34,9;1r17,47,6;1ads,95,6;p43,16,5;fyq,14,5;1zxn,41,5;1s2c,23,5;7vs,80,4
